flowchart TB
    IN["<b>INPUTS</b><br/>Start date<br/>Subjects + optional topics<br/>Exam date per subject<br/>Difficulty: Easy / Medium / Hard<br/>Weekday and weekend study hours<br/>Preferred slot: Morning / Afternoon / Evening / Night<br/>Extra preferences (free text)<br/><i>Regeneration only:</i> blocked dates + change request"]
    IN --> p1[1. Validation<br/>errors stop here, warnings continue]
    p1 --> p2[2. Planning context<br/>calendar table + target hours table]
    p2 --> p3[3. Prompt P1 - or P2 when regenerating]
    p3 --> p4[4. Gemini 3.6 Flash<br/>JSON mode, temperature 0.3]
    p4 --> p5[5. JSON parse + constraint checker]
    p5 --> OUT["<b>OUTPUTS</b><br/>Day-wise timetable: start, end, subject, activity, topic<br/>Strategy summary + AI warnings<br/>Planned vs target hours per subject - chart<br/>Constraint check: pass or list of violations<br/>Study tips<br/>CSV and JSON download"]
    style IN fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1e88e5,text-align:left
    style OUT fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#43a047
